                                                "sense_id": "88f32e3c-a4bf-3f3f-9f0d-600efadb5c9c",
                                                "text": "The controversial Neknomination craze has reportedly led to the death of another young British man, after a rugby player mixed two pints of gin with teabags and said to the camera: “This is how you drink.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6bc61524-3d65-4f93-bdf4-c6173e5ed48b",
                                                "sense_id": "88f32e3c-a4bf-3f3f-9f0d-600efadb5c9c",
                                                "text": "Ontario Provincial Police laid charges against two young men on Thursday after a ‘neknomination’ video surfaced on social media."
                                            },
                                            {
